WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:04.671
POLAND IS STEPPING IN AS
PRESSURE GROWS ON GERMAN TO

00:00:04.671 --> 00:00:06.706
SUPPLY CRANE WITH THE BATTLE
TANKS.

00:00:06.706 --> 00:00:11.077
OTHER COUNTRIES HAVE THEM AND
WANT TO SEND THEM BUT GERMANY

00:00:11.077 --> 00:00:14.547
MUST SIGN OFF FOR THEM TO BE
TRANSFERRED TO UKRAINE.

00:00:14.547 --> 00:00:20.119
DESPITE THE PRESSURE, BERLIN HAS
RESISTED DOING SO.

00:00:20.119 --> 00:00:22.855
BUT THEY DO EXPECT A DECISION
SOON.

00:00:22.855 --> 00:00:25.425
PRESIDENT ZELENSKYY SAID IT'S
URGENT.

00:00:25.425 --> 00:00:26.826
&gt;&gt; Translator: THIS IS NO TIME
FOR BARGAINING.

00:00:26.826 --> 00:00:31.231
THIS IS A TIME FOR SURVIVAL.
WE NEED TO SURVIVE.

00:00:31.231 --> 00:00:38.304
&gt;&gt; POLAND'S PRIME MINISTER SAID
GERMANY IS WASTING TIME AND

00:00:38.304 --> 00:00:41.774
UNTRUSTWOR
AND, QUOTE, WE WILL NOT PASSIVE

00:00:41.774 --> 00:00:46.613
WATCH UKRAINE BLEED TO DEATH.
JOINING US IS JOHN BOLTON.

00:00:46.613 --> 00:00:48.615
THE FIRST QUESTION HERE, DO YOU
BELIEVE GERMANY SHOULD SIGN OFF

00:00:48.615 --> 00:00:53.253
ON THIS, ON THEM SENDING THE
TANKS AND OTHER COUNTRIES

00:00:53.253 --> 00:00:55.755
SENDING THEM AS WELL?
&gt;&gt; I THINK THEY SHOULD SIGN OFF.

00:00:55.755 --> 00:01:00.593
I THINK GERMANY'S PERFORMANCE
THROUGHOUT THE WAR HAS BEEN

00:01:00.593 --> 00:01:05.131
DISAPPOINTING DESPITE THE
CHANCELLOR'S STATEMENT NEAR THE

00:01:05.131 --> 00:01:09.636
BEGINNING THERE WOULD BE A SEA
CHANGE IN GERMANY'S DEFENSIVE

00:01:09.636 --> 00:01:12.038
POLICIES.
IT HASN'T HAPPENED YET, IT HAS

00:01:12.038 --> 00:01:16.209
TO HAPPEN.
&gt;&gt; DO YOU AGREE THAT THIS

00:01:16.209 --> 00:01:22.482
DELIBERATION THE LAST SEVERAL
WEEKS IS, IN THE END,

00:01:22.482 --> 00:01:24.918
&gt;&gt; OF COURSE IT IS.
IF THEY DON'T HAVE THE

00:01:24.918 --> 00:01:29.889
CAPABILITY TO RESPOND TO
LONG-RUMORED, IMPENDING RUSSIAN

00:01:29.889 --> 00:01:32.926
OFFENSES, THAT'S BAD FOR THE
UKRAINE, BAD FOR THE WEST AS A

00:01:32.926 --> 00:01:34.894
WHOLE.
IT PLAYS INTO THE KREMLIN

00:01:34.894 --> 00:01:37.964
STRATEGY TO WIN POLITICALLY WHAT
THEY CAN'T WIN ON THE

00:01:37.964 --> 00:01:41.301
BATTLEFIELD BY SPLITTING NATO.
&gt;&gt; THE CHAIRMAN OF THE HOUSE

00:01:41.301 --> 00:01:46.439
FOREIGN AFFAIRS COMMITTEE,
MICHAEL McCAUL SAID YESTERDAY HE

00:01:46.439 --> 00:01:49.375
BELIEVES THE UNITED STATES
SHOULD SEND AN ABRAMS TANK, JUST

00:01:49.375 --> 00:01:53.713
ONE, ALL THAT IT WOULD NEED TO
GREEN LIGHT GERMANY SPENDING THE

00:01:53.713 --> 00:01:55.615
LEOPARD TANKS.
SHOULD THE BIDEN ADMINISTRATION

00:01:55.615 --> 00:02:01.988
TAKE THAT STEP IN YOUR VIEW?
&gt;&gt; WELL, I THINK WE SHOULD DO IT

00:02:01.988 --> 00:02:04.023
ANYWAY BECAUSE I THINK THAT'S
RIGHT FOR UKRAINE.

00:02:04.023 --> 00:02:06.726
IF THAT BRINGS THE GERMANS
ALONG, THAT'S GREAT.

00:02:06.726 --> 00:02:09.262
LET'S BE CLEAR.
WE NEED TO HAVE A CONVERSATION

00:02:09.262 --> 00:02:13.432
WITH GERMANY SOONER RATHER THAN
LATER.

00:02:13.432 --> 00:02:17.337
THEY NEED TO STEP UP TO THEIR
ROLE APPROPRIATE TO THEIR SIZE

00:02:17.337 --> 00:02:19.272
ECONOMICALLY.
JAPAN ANNOUNCED IT'S GOING TO

00:02:19.272 --> 00:02:21.808
DOUBLE ITS DEFENSE BUDGET IN THE
NEXT FIVE YEARS.

00:02:21.808 --> 00:02:24.544
WHERE IS GERMANY?
&gt;&gt; ARE YOU CONCERNED WHAT IS

00:02:24.544 --> 00:02:30.283
PLAYING OUT HERE WITH THIS
DECISION MAKES NATO LOOKS

00:02:30.283 --> 00:02:32.952
FRACTURED?
&gt;&gt; WELL, I THINK NATO IS A LOT

00:02:32.952 --> 00:02:35.855
MORE FRACTURED THAN SOME OF ITS
POLITICAL LEADERS WOULD LIKE TO

00:02:35.855 --> 00:02:38.424
LET ON.
THERE'S BEEN A LOT OF PATTING

00:02:38.424 --> 00:02:42.428
OURSELVES ON THE BACK.
LET'S NOT FORGET PUTIN THINKS HE

00:02:42.428 --> 00:02:45.765
KNOWS THE GERMANS WELL.
HE WAS STATIONED THERE IN THE

00:02:45.765 --> 00:02:50.837
KGB, AND I THINK HE SEES GERMANY
AS THE WEAK POINT IN THE

00:02:50.837 --> 00:02:54.707
ALLIANCE.
&gt;&gt; I WANT TO MOVE TO THE

00:02:54.707 --> 00:02:57.577
ANNOUNCEMENT THAT THE FBI
SEARCHED PRESIDENT BIDEN'S HOME,

00:02:57.577 --> 00:03:06.352
WHICH THE WHITE HOUSE SAYS WAS
DONE IN COORDINATION WITH HIS

00:03:06.352 --> 00:03:07.487
ATTORNEYS, NOT DONE WITH A
SEARCH WARRANT.

00:03:07.487 --> 00:03:10.490
IT IS CONCERNING TO SEE THE FBI
GOING INTO THE HOME OF A SITTING

00:03:10.490 --> 00:03:12.959
PRESIDENT TO SEARCH THAT.
WHAT DOES THAT SAY TO YOU ABOUT

00:03:12.959 --> 00:03:14.727
THE SERIOUSNESS OF THE
INVESTIGATION INTO THE

00:03:14.727 --> 00:03:16.262
CLASSIFIED DOCUMENTS THAT WERE
TAKEN?

00:03:16.262 --> 00:03:19.732
&gt;&gt; I THINK IT'S GOING TO GET A
LOT MORE SERIOUS FOR BIDEN, THE

00:03:19.732 --> 00:03:23.069
FACT THAT APPARENTLY SOME OF
THESE CLASSIFIED DOCUMENTS GO

00:03:23.069 --> 00:03:26.406
ALL THE WAY BACK TO HIS SENATE
DAYS AND YET HAVE TRAVELED

00:03:26.406 --> 00:03:30.310
AROUND WITH HIM.
IT'S AN INCREDIBLE GIFT TO

00:03:30.310 --> 00:03:32.945
DONALD TRUMP THAT IN MANY
PEOPLE'S MINDS, NOT THE LEAST OF

00:03:32.945 --> 00:03:38.418
WHICH ARE SENATOR DICK DURBIN,
SENATOR JOE MANCHIN, TWO

00:03:38.418 --> 00:03:40.119
DEMOCRATS WHO SAID YESTERDAY
THEY THOUGHT THE ADMINISTRATION

00:03:40.119 --> 00:03:42.689
HAD BEEN DAMAGED.
WE NEED TO DO A LOT MORE IN THE

00:03:42.689 --> 00:03:45.491
TRANSITION PROCESS TO MAKE SURE
THESE CLASSIFIED DOCUMENTS GO

00:03:45.491 --> 00:03:49.829
WHERE THEY'RE SUPPOSED TO GO AT
THE END OF AN ADMINISTRATION.

00:03:49.829 --> 00:03:52.565
&gt;&gt; TRUMP HAS ARGUED THAT THE
JUSTICE DEPARTMENT IS TREATING

00:03:52.565 --> 00:03:54.701
BIDEN DIFFERENTLY THAN THEY'RE
TREATING HIM.

00:03:54.701 --> 00:03:57.804
IS TRUMP WRONG ABOUT THAT IN
YOUR VIEW.

00:03:57.804 --> 00:04:04.210
&gt;&gt; WELL, THEY ARE TREATING BIDEN
DIFFERENTLY BECAUSE TRUMP

00:04:04.210 --> 00:04:05.678
TREATED THE JUSTICE DEPARTMENT
DIFFERENTLY, AND THE TWO ARE NOT

00:04:05.678 --> 00:04:08.981
EQUAL, THAT'S FOR SURE.
I THINK POLITICALLY BIDEN'S

00:04:08.981 --> 00:04:12.618
SELF-INFLICTED WOUNDS HAVE
PRETTY MUCH ABSOLVE TRUMP FROM

00:04:12.618 --> 00:04:15.355
THE PROSPECT OF PROSECUTION.
IT'S HARD TO PROSECUTE A FORMER

00:04:15.355 --> 00:04:18.558
PRESIDENT TO BEGIN WITH.
I THINK BIDEN'S ERRORS HERE MAKE

00:04:18.558 --> 00:04:21.828
IT ALMOST IMPOSSIBLE.
&gt;&gt; YOU THINK TRUMP WON'T BE

00:04:21.828 --> 00:04:23.796
PROSECUTED BECAUSE OF WHAT'S
HAPPENED WITH BIDEN?

00:04:23.796 --> 00:04:27.100
&gt;&gt; NOT ON THE DOCUMENTS.
NOW, THE JANUARY 6th

00:04:27.100 --> 00:04:28.968
PROSECUTION, THE GEORGIA
INVESTIGATION, THOSE ARE

00:04:28.968 --> 00:04:32.071
DIFFERENT.
BUT ON THE DOCUMENTS FRONT, I

00:04:32.071 --> 00:04:36.809
THINK HE'S SKIPPED FREE AGAIN.
&gt;&gt; NOT EVEN ON THE OBSTRUCTION

00:04:36.809 --> 00:04:38.444
FRONT?
THAT IS WHAT THE WHITE HOUSE HAS

00:04:38.444 --> 00:04:42.181
DRAWN AS THE DISTINCTION, SAYING
WE'RE COOPERATING WITH THE

00:04:42.181 --> 00:04:43.916
ARCHIVES AND THE JUSTICE
DEPARTMENT.

00:04:43.916 --> 00:04:49.489
TRUMP FOUGHT THEM FOR A YEAR AND
A HALF THAT LED TO THE SEARCH OF

00:04:49.489 --> 00:04:50.890
TRUMP'S HOME.
&gt;&gt; HERE IS KEY POINT.

00:04:50.890 --> 00:04:54.360
WE ALL SAY AND IT'S RIGHT TO SAY
EVERYBODY IS UNDER THE SAME RULE

00:04:54.360 --> 00:04:56.496
OF LAW.
NOBODY IS TREATED DIFFERENTLY,

00:04:56.496 --> 00:04:59.632
BUT I WILL SAY THIS.
IF THE JUSTICE DEPARTMENT

00:04:59.632 --> 00:05:04.904
INDICTS A FORMER PRESIDENT AND
FAILS TO GET A CONVICTION, THE

00:05:04.904 --> 00:05:07.039
POLITICAL FIRESTORM THAT WOULD
ENSUE WOULD TARNISH THE

00:05:07.039 --> 00:05:10.243
DEPARTMENT FOR YEARS.
YOU HAVE TO WEIGH THAT IN THE

00:05:10.243 --> 00:05:11.911
BALANCE.
YOU CAN'T JUST BE SURE THAT YOU

00:05:11.911 --> 00:05:17.350
THINK YOU CAN PROVE GUILT BEYOND
A REASONABLE DOUBT.

00:05:17.350 --> 00:05:21.053
YOU BETTER DO IT.
IF YOU FAIL, TRUMP COULD RIDE

00:05:21.053 --> 00:05:22.922
THAT TO THE WHITE HOUSE I'M
AFRAID.

00:05:22.922 --> 00:05:28.728
&gt;&gt; SECRETARY POMPEO WHO YOU
SERVED WITH HAS WRITTEN A NEW

00:05:28.728 --> 00:05:33.199
BOOK, MEMOIR, WHO IS DOWN RIGHT
SCATHING OF HIS ASSESSMENT OF

00:05:33.199 --> 00:05:35.268
YOU.
HE WRITES JOHN BOLTON SHOULD BE

00:05:35.268 --> 00:05:37.970
IN JAIL FOR SPILLING CLASSIFIED
INFORMATION.

00:05:37.970 --> 00:05:41.607
I HOPE I CAN ONE DAY TESTIFY AT
A CRIMINAL TRIAL AS A WITNESS

00:05:41.607 --> 00:05:45.211
FOR THE PROSECUTION.
HE SAYS YOURSELF-SERVING STORIES

00:05:45.211 --> 00:05:50.883
CONTAINED CLASSIFIED INFO AND
DEEPLY SENSITIVE DETAILS

00:05:50.883 --> 00:05:53.219
INVOLVING A SITTING
COMMANDER-IN-CHIEF.

00:05:53.219 --> 00:05:55.154
WHAT'S YOUR RESPONSE TO
SECRETARY POMPEO?

00:05:55.154 --> 00:05:59.058
&gt;&gt; WELL, WHAT HE KNOWS IN FACT
OR SHOULD KNOW IS MY BOOK WENT

00:05:59.058 --> 00:06:03.729
THROUGH A FOUR-MONTH-LONG PRE
PUBLICATION REVIEW PROCESS

00:06:03.729 --> 00:06:07.533
PRECISELY TO MAKE SURE THERE WAS
NO CLASSIFIED INFORMATION IN THE

00:06:07.533 --> 00:06:09.368
BOOK.
IT WAS ARDUOUS AT TIMES I CAN

00:06:09.368 --> 00:06:11.904
TELL YOU.
THE NATIONAL SECURITY COUNCIL

00:06:11.904 --> 00:06:16.175
SENIOR DIRECTOR RESPONSIBLE FOR
THAT REVIEW CLEARED THE BOOK,

00:06:16.175 --> 00:06:19.912
AND INSIDE THE WHITE HOUSE,
BECAUSE DONALD TRUMP DIDN'T WANT

00:06:19.912 --> 00:06:24.350
THE BOOK PUBLISHED BEFORE THE
ELECTION, HE FIRED THE SENIOR

00:06:24.350 --> 00:06:28.154
DIRECTOR, A CAREER EMPLOYEE OF
THE NATIONAL ARCHIVES FROM HER

00:06:28.154 --> 00:06:30.990
JOB AND TRIED TO GET ANOTHER
REVIEW GOING.

00:06:30.990 --> 00:06:35.561
AN INTERESTING POINT HERE, AND
THIS IS CRITICAL, BEFORE THE

00:06:35.561 --> 00:06:39.365
JUSTICE DEPARTMENT WAS ORDERED
TO BRING THE SUIT TO STOP

00:06:39.365 --> 00:06:44.770
PUBLICATION OF MY BOOK, THEY
INTERVIEWED THE SENIOR DIRECTOR

00:06:44.770 --> 00:06:47.807
ELLEN KNIGHT FOR 18 HOURS OVER
FIVE DAYS IN THE WHITE HOUSE.

00:06:47.807 --> 00:06:51.410
THEY MUST HAVE FORGOTTEN THE
THUMB SCREWS AND THE RUBBER

00:06:51.410 --> 00:06:54.247
HOSES TO GET HER TO CHANGE HER
STORY, AND SHE WOULDN'T.

00:06:54.247 --> 00:06:57.550
THE BOOK WAS CLEARED, AND I
THINK IF THERE'S AN

00:06:57.550 --> 00:07:01.087
INVESTIGATIVE REPORTER THAT HAS
SPARE TIME, THEY OUGHT TO LOOK

00:07:01.087 --> 00:07:04.123
AT WHO IN THE WHAUS AND
ELSEWHERE IN THE ADMINISTRATION,

00:07:04.123 --> 00:07:08.294
IN THE COUNSEL'S OFFICE, THE TOP
POLITICAL LEVELS AT THE JUSTICE

00:07:08.294 --> 00:07:11.130
DEPARTMENT FOLLOWED TRUMP'S
ORDERS TO TRY TO SUPPRESS THE

00:07:11.130 --> 00:07:12.732
BOOK.
I'M NOT TALKING ABOUT THE LINE

00:07:12.732 --> 00:07:16.402
ATTORNEYS AT THE DEPARTMENT OF
JUSTICE, BUT TRUMP'S TOP

00:07:16.402 --> 00:07:18.604
ADVISERS WHO WERE CONTENT TO TRY
AND SUPPRESS IT.

00:07:18.604 --> 00:07:21.374
&gt;&gt; YOU'RE IMPLYING THAT
SOMETHING ILLEGAL HAPPENED?

00:07:21.374 --> 00:07:27.146
WHAT ARE YOU SAYING THERE?
&gt;&gt; WELL, REPORTERS SHELTER UNDER

00:07:27.146 --> 00:07:29.916
THE FIRST AMENDMENT FREQUENTLY.
I'M SURE THAT'S MUCH ON YOUR

00:07:29.916 --> 00:07:33.519
MIND.
THIS IS A CLASSIC EFFORT BY

00:07:33.519 --> 00:07:37.723
TRUMP AT PRIOR RESTRAINT.
IN FACT, I WAS TOLD THAT A VERY

00:07:37.723 --> 00:07:42.228
TOP JUSTICE DEPARTMENT OFFICIAL
ON HEARING THAT THE BOOK HAD

00:07:42.228 --> 00:07:47.133
BEEN CLEARED SAID, AND I QUOTE,
ROUGHLY, I DON'T GIVE A BLANK

00:07:47.133 --> 00:07:49.335
ABOUT THE FACTS, I WANT THE CASE
BROUGHT.

00:07:49.335 --> 00:07:53.005
I THINK THERE'S A LOT THERE.
THIS IS ENTIRELY CONSISTENT WITH

00:07:53.005 --> 00:07:55.608
TRUMP BEHAVIOR, TRYING TO
SUPPRESS OTHER BOOKS.

00:07:55.608 --> 00:07:58.477
THAT'S WHAT HAPPENED HERE.
I THINK POMPEO KNOWS OR SHOULD

00:07:58.477 --> 00:08:02.515
HAVE KNOWN ABOUT IT.
IF HE DIDN'T KNOW ABOUT IT, IT'S

00:08:02.515 --> 00:08:05.117
INCOMPETENCE IN WRITING THE BOOK
FOR NOT CHECKING OUT THE FACTS

00:08:05.117 --> 00:08:10.489
BEFORE HE PUT IT DOWN ON PAPER.
IF HE DID KNOW ABOUT IT, THAT'S

00:08:10.489 --> 00:08:14.527
MALICIOUS AND WELL BEYOND
RECKLESS TO SAY THINGS LIKE

00:08:14.527 --> 00:08:16.162
THAT.
&gt;&gt; AMBASSADOR JOHN BOLTON, THANK

00:08:16.162 --> 00:08:16.695
YOU FOR JOINING US THIS MORNING.

